          "key": "WindowManager::GetAll",
          "kind": "method",
          "doc": {
            "summary": "Get all managed windows",
            "details": "Returns a vector containing all currently managed window instances. The returned vector is a snapshot of the current state and modifications to it won't affect the internal window registry.\n\n```cpp\nauto all_windows = WindowManager::GetInstance().GetAll();\nfor (auto& window : all_windows) {\n    window->Hide();  // Hide all windows\n}\n```",
